Week 6: Neural Networks & Deep Learning
📋 Learning Objectives
By the end of this week, you will be able to:

✅ Understand the architecture of neural networks

✅ Implement forward and backward propagation from scratch

✅ Build and train neural networks with TensorFlow/Keras

✅ Understand activation functions and their use cases

✅ Implement regularization techniques to prevent overfitting

✅ Tune hyperparameters for optimal performance

✅ Build deep neural networks for complex problems

✅ Use callbacks for efficient training

✅ Save and load trained models
✅ Build an image classifier with convolutional layers
